  "title": "Royal Gold Presenting at the Mining Forum Europe 2026 Conference",
  "summary": "Royal Gold, Inc. (NASDAQ: RGLD) (together with its subsidiaries, “Royal Gold,” or the “Company”) announced today that management will present at the Mining Forum Europe 2026 conference in Zurich, Switzerland. Dan Breeze, Senior Vice President, Corporate Development, RGLD Gold AG, will present to conference participants on Tuesday, April 14, at 9:50 a.m. CEST (3:50 a.m. ET / 1:50 a.m. MT). The 20-minute presentation will be live streamed on the Company’s website at www.royalgold.com , under the I",
